00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:55.810
- That's a quick PCA pump.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:57.730
A PCA pump is a pump that's controlled

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:59.659
by the patient in order
to give them anesthesia,

00:03:59.659 --> 00:04:01.820
usually there's an opioid in there.

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.500
