00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:05.570
give themself dosages,
but if they're using

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:06.960
it too frequently it times out

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:08.570
and doesn't allow them to do it.

00:04:08.570 --> 00:04:10.530
Now, this is good because when patients

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:13.750
have that ability to
control their pain relief,

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:15.300
they generally use less of it

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:18.440
and are more aware of
how much they're using,

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:19.620
as opposed to when a nurse comes in

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:21.440
and doses it, they may overuse.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.690
